## Skills

Skills live under `.ai/skills/<id>/skill.md`. When a task matches a skill's purpose, read its `skill.md` and follow it.

| Skill | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| plan-foundation | P0–P6 orchestration; certify plan-master-ready |
| plan-master | Master implementation plan; certify implementation-ready |
| plan-verify / plan-repair | Plan audits; remediate gaps |
| session-control | Session open/close; HANDOFF, NEXT; optional git |
| code-implementation | Iteration execution from NEXT.md |
| code-verify / code-repair | Milestone/uncommitted audits; fix findings |
| dev-stack | Isolated Docker Compose dev stack (`bin/start.sh`) |
| db-migration | Idempotent numbered SQL (N/A v1) |
| feature-spec | Author, review, amend feature SPECs |
| concept-run | Run MOD-01…MOD-07 concept prompts |
| process-router | Read-only process Q&A |
| ai-director / x-director | Free-text orchestrators |

**New skills:** add `.ai/skills/<id>/skill.md`; register above. Naming: `.ai/skills/README.md` § `{domain}-{role}`, kebab-case.

