## UI Design OS (thin-client)

**Coexistence:** [`.ai.ui/COHABITATION.md`](.ai.ui/COHABITATION.md) — UI skills write to `.work.ui/` only; do not overwrite `.work/plans/NEXT.md` except cross-links.

**Lost on UI?** [`.ai.ui/START_HERE.md`](.ai.ui/START_HERE.md) · **Router:** `@ui-process-router - <question>` · **Free-text:** `@ui-director - <describe what you want>`

### UI change safety

Run before `@ui-component-build complete`:

| Gate | Command | Fail when |
|------|---------|-----------|
| Touch scope | `bash /mnt/work/Projects/.ai.ui/scripts/touch-scope-verify.sh` | File outside `.work.ui/touch-scope` |
| Blast radius | `bash /mnt/work/Projects/.ai.ui/scripts/blast-radius-check.sh` | Cross-area diff ≥3 areas |
| Tests | `bash /mnt/work/Projects/.ai.ui/scripts/framework-verify.sh` | Non-zero exit |
| Gate check | `bash /mnt/work/Projects/.ai.ui/scripts/gate-verify.sh` | Done task with empty Notes |

**Declare scope first:** `.work.ui/touch-scope` (copy from `$AI_UI_SOURCE/templates/work.ui/touch-scope.template` if missing).

### UI completion gate (addition to Core Principle 7)

UI milestone work is not done until: UI lint/type/tests pass; `@ui-visual-verify` + `@ui-accessibility-audit` pass or are waived in `{HANDOFF_UI}`; agent-assisted UI has `@ui-concept-run - UIS-06` unless **`human-only`** in the same message.

### UI key paths

| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `DOCS_UI_STACK.md` | Front-end stack |
| `.work.ui/context/HANDOFF_UI.md` | UI handoff |
| `.work.ui/plans/NEXT_UI.md` | UI iteration |
| `frontend/` | App root |
| `frontend/src/styles/tokens.css` | Design tokens |

**UIS gates before `ui-component-build complete`:** UIS-06 (agent-assisted) · UIS-07 (craft ≥ refined) · UIS-08 (all screens) · UIS-09 (analytical dashboards).

### UI skills (`@ui-*` only)

ui-bootstrap · ui-design-foundation · ui-screen-spec · ui-component-build · ui-visual-verify · ui-accessibility-audit · ui-design-system · ui-concept-run · ui-plan-verify · ui-copy · ui-director · ui-process-router — see `.ai.ui/skills/README.md`.

